#X text 1300 780 The count waits 2 s \, as a print does (C-9): u_err may log it \, and the deploy check fails on any output before about 735 ms. None found is info \, not warn: the Mac and the gates have no samples \, and a silent drum page says so on the rig. Some but not all is a warn \, drawn on every page., f 50;
