#X text 20 1140 e_tape takes everything on \$0-out \, the delays and the reverb \, and keeps the last while of it \, so a held repeat replays their tails and makes no new ones (Brendan \, 2026-11-05). The voices' dry sound goes round it \, on its own cords. The catch~ is never switched off: the sends are zeroed instead (ref/module/sequencer.md)., f 60;
