#X text 20 1240 e_rush takes the kit's whole output \, the voices and e_tape's \, and keeps the last while of it: past the handoff of knob 4 \, rush \, it loops the last steps of that in place of the kit \, faster and faster (Brendan \, 2026-11-05). c_steps says when. ref/module/sequencer.md, f 60;
